  "comments": [
    "[decision] No apiEndpoint on the Clients read model; used table 'clients' from backend migration V1__clients.sql instead of blocking. 'Create invoice' links to /new-invoice?clientId=.",
    "[limitation] test-analyzer skill not installed, so no code-slice.json was produced for Clients.",
    "Slice \"Clients\" was auto-blocked by the Ralph loop. Ralph loop picked up this slice 5 times in a row without its status ever leaving \"Planned\" — the build agent kept declining to build it, or kept building it but its own status change kept getting reverted (e.g. a failed check). Auto-blocked to stop the loop from retrying it forever."
  ]
